k to real source code 3. the pseudocode is persisted alongside the generated code, making your prompt effectively a stored record of intent.&lt;/code&gt;它可能不适用于所有用例，但在我最初的游戏中，我发现它非常有趣。&lt;code&gt; 1. write pseudocode in whatever way makes the most sense to you 2. on save, the editor synchronizes your work to real source code 3. the pseudocode is persisted alongside the generated code, making your prompt effectively a stored record of intent.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;现在这只是一个概念证明 - 安装说明位于自述文件中： &lt;a href="https://github.com/danielvaughn/hz" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://github.com/danielvaughn/hz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;您还可以在此处观看其实际操作视频： &lt;a href="https://x.com/danielvaughn/status/2090456808431165715" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://x.com/danielvaughn/status/2090456808431165715&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;干杯!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;评论网址： &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49378768"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?&lt;/a&gt; id=49378768&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;积分：333&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; # 评论：178&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 19:05:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.danielvaughn.dev/posts/huzzah/</guid></item><item><title>研究显示观看 TikTok 和 Instagram 会停用认知控制网络</title><link>https://www.rathbiotaclan.com/tiktok-videos-deactivate-key-cognitive-brain-regions/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;文章网址： &lt;a href="https://www.rathbiotaclan.com/tiktok-videos-deactivate-key-cognitive-brain-regions/"&gt;https://www.rathbiotaclan.com/tiktok-videos-deactivate-key-cognitive-brain-regions/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;评论网址： &lt;a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49378630"&gt;https://news.ycombinator.com/item?&lt;/a&gt; id=49378630&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;积分：340&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; # 评论: 117&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 18:54:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rathbiotaclan.com/tiktok-videos-deactivate-key-cognitive-brain-regions/</guid></item><item><title>为什么聪明人不快乐？ (2022)</title><link>https://www.experimental-his